      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns/Skill",
      "name": "figure-rebuild",
      "title": "Figure rebuild: a figure is data, not a picture",
      "description": "Turn a figure into a computable diagram: every figure of a source publication when a folio is built from its L1 entry, and any hand-drawn figure in a folio, an IG or a demonstrator that is redrawn from a source. Every declared figure gets a block, and each one is rebuilt in the form its type calls for: an ArchiMate view, BPMN, DMN, a FHIR logical model, or an SVG generated from data, always from one schema-backed source. The PDF crop stays beside the rebuild as the cited source, and the rebuild keeps the original's layout. The figure-coverage check counts what is missing and what is still only a picture.",
